ons (verifyLines, verifyOneLine, computeFileDigest, digestAndPrint, openInput), then run `go vet ./pkg/hashutil/...` to verify compilation. The full planned code for this file is documented in section 3 above. This directly continues the task described in the user's prompt: \"Implement ParseChecksumLine, VerifyChecksums, DigestFiles\" per srd086-hashutil R3.1, R3.2.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/pdiddy/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-dl-cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn-T-go-unix-utils-worktrees-5106/3ce4b834-9763-4ac2-9cd8-c96dba42c885.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ce4b834-9763-4ac2-9cd8-c96dba42c885","uuid":"9f7027d5-d8f6-4a8d-813a-4e745d04120b","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:36:29.901Z","isSynthetic":true}
